 # Architecture
 
 This file stores cross-cutting rules that apply to the whole repo and to projects cloned from it.
+Keep the deployed starter Worker Web-standards-only; on compatibility dates that default Node.js support on, use the platform's explicit opt-out flags unless an ADR adopts Node runtime APIs.
+Keep the npm package module format explicit.
+Run generated Worker binding drift checks in the normal quality gate of every project that commits those declarations.
+Keep inference, room-reset, and deployment lifecycle logs structured, bounded, and free of sensitive payloads.
